SUMMARY:Brian Francis Baudoin at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Brian Francis Baudoin is originally from Kaplan\, Louisiana. He spent most of his lifetime as a live solo acoustic performing songwriter touring in the South. With a passion for his art and an entrepreneurial spirit\, he set out for Nashville where he lived for several years honing his craft in the heart of country music. Brian has now settled in Northern California where he continues to work on his legacy as an artist. \n 
