SUMMARY:Early Access 2026 Spring Plant Sale-Petaluma Bounty Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Bounty’s Spring Plant Sale is on April 25\, but we will have a pre-sale for some of the plants which experienced a growth spurt due to the recent warm weather. Plants on sale will include tomatoes\, peppers\, squashes and eggplants\, ready to go into your garden! We will offer 50% off to CalFresh customers but we won’t be able to run your EBT card so please bring cash\, checks\, or cards. Questions? Email masako@petalumabounty.org.
