SUMMARY:Spark the Future!
DESCRIPTION:Spark the Future is CTE Foundation’s annual celebration and signature fundraiser\, bringing the community together to highlight the incredible impact that career-connected learning has on Sonoma County students. This inspiring evening features a Student Showcase where over 125 students from 15 local high schools proudly present hands-on projects developed in their Career Technical Education (CTE) classes. From engineering feats to culinary creations\, attendees can interact with students\, learn about their work\, and even cast votes to directly support the programs they love. \nIn addition to the Student Showcase\, guests will enjoy dinner\, drinks\, and a live program that showcases stories of student success and the real-world impact of career-connected learning. Spark the Future showcases the talent\, ambition\, and creativity of students while raising critical funds to expand programs that prepare youth for meaningful futures. \nSpark the Future highlights the power of career-connected education and bridges the gap between schools and the local workforce. Attendees have the unique opportunity to see firsthand how CTE programs equip students with real skills\, confidence\, and clarity about their future career paths.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spark-the-future/
LOCATION:The Backdrop\, 1455 Corporate Center Pkwy\, Santa Rosa\, 95407
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
